  "note": "The machine-readable rendering of MODULE_AUTHORING_WIRE.md sections M5, M6, M8, M9 and M10. A DOCUMENT profile, not an evaluator profile: it registers no placement and declares no runtime facet, so it carries no facets block and no facet families. Stable at 1.0: section M2 states what that promises and the evidence the profile was promoted on. Its one profile-token slot, the module root's view, adopts server-app-host's moduleRef.view vocabulary by reference rather than by copy, so a module body and the reference to it range over one set.",
